{"id":"331efd41ed572fd4","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-low-fpf-not-ce.md","title":"低度 FPF 展示 Arslanov 的 c.e. 前提","display":"ex-low-fpf-not-ce — 低度 FPF 展示 Arslanov 的 c.e. 前提","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-low-fpf-not-ce","aliases":["20-ex-low-fpf-not-ce"],"display":"ex-low-fpf-not-ce — 低度 FPF 展示 Arslanov 的 c.e. 前提","chapter":"5","section":"5.4.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 5.4.14","source_printed_pages":[121],"source_pdf_pages":[156],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-dnc2-special-class]]","[[20-thm-low-basis]]","[[20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees]]","[[20-thm-arslanov]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-low-fpf-not-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-low-fpf-not-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-low-fpf-not-ce — 低度 FPF 展示 Arslanov 的 c.e. 前提"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.4.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>121</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>156</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b06b2873482f11f7\" href=\"?note=b06b2873482f11f7\" title=\"20-thm-dnc2-special-class\">20-thm-dnc2-special-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84e66db8dad1fed1\" href=\"?note=84e66db8dad1fed1\" title=\"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees\">20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d1387be254aae2b\" href=\"?note=1d1387be254aae2b\" title=\"20-thm-arslanov\">20-thm-arslanov</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>普通 Low₁ 与集合外延 FPF 使用已有定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b06b2873482f11f7\" href=\"?note=b06b2873482f11f7\" title=\"20-thm-dnc2-special-class\">20-thm-dnc2-special-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"84e66db8dad1fed1\" href=\"?note=84e66db8dad1fed1\" title=\"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees\">20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d1387be254aae2b\" href=\"?note=1d1387be254aae2b\" title=\"20-thm-arslanov\">20-thm-arslanov</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}low-fpf-not-ce}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [f\\le_T A\\land \\operatorname{Low}_1(A)\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\land A\\notin\\mathcal E].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}low-fpf-not-ce}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [f\\le_T A\\land \\operatorname{Low}_1(A)\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\land A\\notin\\mathcal E].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>低基在二值 DNC 特殊类中给低的非可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；三向编译定理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算 FPF。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> c.e.，Arslanov 将给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\equiv_T0\\prime\\)</span>，但 low₁ 则使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\)</span>，与跳跃严格性矛盾。此处“不是 c.e.”指该集合；事实上该度也没有 c.e. 代表。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 5.4.14；印刷页 121；PDF 第 156 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-dnc2-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"b06b2873482f11f7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dnc2-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low-basis","status":"resolved","id":"04a511cfa9ffa494","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"84e66db8dad1fed1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-arslanov","status":"resolved","id":"1d1387be254aae2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-arslanov]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dnc2-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"b06b2873482f11f7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dnc2